title: "Researk"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Researk contributors"
abstract: >-
  A local-first, open-source harness and command-line interface for specialized
  scientific research, academic writing, analysis, revision, and paper
  reproduction workflows with provider- and model-agnostic language models.
license: Apache-2.0
